SCOPE OF THIS LICENCE
================================================================================
The MIT licence below applies ONLY to the analysis code in this repository: the
Python files under analysis/ and publication/, and the scripts and documentation
written by the author.

It does NOT apply to the AlphaGenome-derived data and prediction files, which
carry non-commercial restrictions that the MIT licence would otherwise appear to
override. Those files, and the restrictions on them, are listed in
LEGALLY_BINDING_TERMS_OF_USE.txt in this directory. Read that file before using
anything in data/ or results/.

Nothing in this MIT licence grants any right to use AlphaGenome Output or Output
Derivatives commercially.

Third-party data redistributed here remains under the licence of its source:
the EMBL-EBI eQTL Catalogue under CC BY 4.0, ENCODE and GTEx under their own
terms, and AlphaGenome material as set out in LEGALLY_BINDING_TERMS_OF_USE.txt.

